/-!
# Public Quillen K-theory library

This entrypoint provides exact categories, canonical K-maps, small-model
transport, abelian dévissage, Serre localization, finite-module G-localization,
and the geometric scheme interfaces.
For smaller imports use the thematic modules above. `Quillen.Scheme` also
provides a focused entrypoint for the geometric interfaces.
-/
